      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2646 - In a narration from Abu Basir, from Imam (as), he said:\n\"My father (as) used to tie his money securely around his waist, as it was part of completing his Hajj.\""
        ]
      }
